WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:07,050
Don't be like this, everyone

2
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:08,250
I look inside my heart

3
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:09,450
It's uncomfortable

4
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:13,320
I feel uncomfortable

5
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,720
Just want to eat

6
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:32,260
Use the corpse snake to give us some food

7
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:34,660
Just let us live on

8
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:40,910
Don't blame me for not giving you a chance

9
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:44,220
Who among you will deal with Chen Zhenghan?

10
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:47,510
I'll take care of him eating all the noodles he can.
